@ref Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954, Schedule, Part 1, definition of “amend” (src:88)
`the definition in the Schedule of amend` MEANS
    `Defined expression` OF "amend", `includes`, NOTHING,
        (LIST "add to", "substitute", "vary", "repeal", "revoke"),
        "shall include “add to”, “substitute”, “vary”, “repeal” and “revoke”"

